    "The Council consider that the impact of the proposed development, by reason of its depth and proximity to the boundary of the site, would unacceptably harm the amenity of  the adjacent neighbours at No.161 Harrow Crescent, Romford by reason of loss of light, outlook and overbearing effect on this property.",
